# Testing (Vitest)

- Use **Vitest** only (`npm test` / `npm run test:watch`). Do not add Jest.
- Put unit tests under `/tests`, mirroring app structure where practical.
- For new logic (functions, managers, routes helpers): include at least
  - 1 expected-use case
  - 1 edge case
  - 1 failure case
- After changing logic covered by tests, update those tests in the same change set.
